Decompose the <optical tensor> on the two-dimensional screen space as
$$
\widehat B_{ab}
=\frac12\theta P_{ab}
+\widehat\sigma_{ab}
+\widehat\omega_{ab}.
$$
The <null expansion>, <null shear>, and <null twist> are respectively
$$
\boxed{\theta=P^{ab}\widehat B_{ab}},
\qquad
\boxed{\widehat\sigma_{ab}
=\widehat B_{(ab)}-\frac12\theta P_{ab}},
\qquad
\boxed{\widehat\omega_{ab}=\widehat B_{[ab]}}.
$$
The shear is symmetric and trace-free, while the twist is antisymmetric.

